   "explanation": {
    "en": "Linkage: an ambidentate ligand binds through a different atom. Ionisation: a ligand and a counter-ion swap. Coordination: ligands swap between a complex cation and a complex anion. Solvate (hydrate): water moves in or out of the coordination sphere."
   }
